    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Identify the routing-confidence signal available from the single agent turn.</step>
    <step order="2">Produce dispatchUncertain from it and feed the Confirm When Uncertain tier in the gate.</step>
    <step order="3">Verify low-confidence fires the gate; high-confidence does not.</step>
    <step order="4">Add seam + unit tests; assert no new scorer/classifier was introduced (FR-E4-adjacent).</step>
    <step order="5">Build + publish-size. Update TASK-INDEX.md 022 → ✅.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If a usable confidence signal is not exposed by the existing agent turn, STOP and escalate rather than adding a second scoring stage (ADR-039).</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <tools>
    <tool name="dotnet">Build + test BFF (unit + seam)</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
